==Log==
When an expedition is completed, a log will be displayed containing messages describing events in the expedition. All expedition log lines are of the form "<character> <action> <situation>" like the following: {{/Message}} Below is a table with the different possible actions and situations in the lines (character names are listed above under Helper Names).

{{/Log Messages}}
</div>

==Tips==
*If you are not looking for certain Battle Items or Catseyes specifically, it is recommended to keep doing expeditions in the latest area to increase GAMATOTO's level quicker.
*Save any Catamins you get for the most rewarding levels and use them only at the start after a transformation phase point, such as when you have leveled up to level 19 due to earlier stages only having very small XP rewards.
*Sending GAMATOTO to any area that drops [[Battle Items#Treasure Radar|Treasure Radars]] while he's in a Zoned-in state can be great way to keep up a semi-constant supply of them.
*Do not dismiss your helpers easily; the chance to find a helper is very rare and they are more valuable as helpers rather than [[Ototo Corps]] engineers. Only dismiss helpers if you are at max capacity or if you desperately need Ototo Engineers.
*Sending GAMATOTO on 1-hour expeditions is a faster way of recruiting helpers if you are really desperate to recruit more.
*In recovery mode, the expedition timer will not tick down unless the app is in active use.
*For more info about item/helper chances and a chances calculator, make copy of this [https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1_4UTvktg9yiVPHjCZaiqSu2XBtRFPQReOF66sMRm9pA/edit?usp=sharing spreadsheet] (outdated, lacks data of Raisin' the Bar).

